# 2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Develop a simple, beautiful and secure resident mobile application for apartment communities.

The application must allow residents to:

1. Log in using their registered mobile number and password.
2. Access only their authorized flat details.
3. View monthly maintenance dues and outstanding balances.
4. Submit maintenance payment details.
5. Upload UPI or bank payment evidence.
6. Track payment approval status.
7. Receive official PDF receipts after Treasurer approval.
8. Download previous receipts.
9. View their flat-wise maintenance statement.
10. Register and track complaints.
11. Read community announcements.
12. View upcoming meetings and events.
13. Receive payment reminders and important notifications.
14. Update permitted profile details.

The application must be free for residents to register, log in and use.

Do not introduce per-resident subscription charges or pay-per-login fees.

The association may bear reasonable hosting, development, notification or support costs.

