# 17. WEBSITE AND APP SYNCHRONIZATION

The resident app and community website must share the same financial source of truth.

Do not maintain independent payment balances in the mobile app.

### Synchronization rules

- Website-generated bills appear in the resident app.
- Resident payment submissions appear in the Treasurer Dashboard.
- Treasurer approval updates the shared financial records.
- Approved receipts become available in the resident app.
- Website announcements appear in the app.
- Resident complaints appear in the committee complaint dashboard.
- Committee updates appear in the resident app after successful saving.

Use server-side APIs and authorization for every operation.

Implement refresh behavior, appropriate caching and error handling.

Do not allow offline cached financial records to be treated as authoritative.

